{
  "version": "security-profile-v1",
  "source": {
    "files": [
      {
        "path": "SKILL.md",
        "content": "---\nname: document-bundle-delivery\ndescription: 转换清单中的文档、打包转换产物并交付到用户指定位置。\n---\n\n# 多文档处理与交付\n\n必须执行 [流程说明](references/workflow.md) 中的要求；该文件是当前流程的组成部分。\n",
        "sha256": "8f084e358a9514452cbfd3aef600d266e061b04f0b1e7d0dec4993e685454485"
      },
      {
        "path": "references/workflow.md",
        "content": "# 文档流程\n\n读取用户提供的 manifest.json，按其中 paths 列表获取文档路径，并从请求中读取 output_dir 和 delivery_path。\n\n- 转换阶段：\n  - 逐个执行 python scripts/convert.py <文档路径> <output_dir>，把每次标准输出作为对应的转换产物路径。\n  - 转换期间保留原文标题；该要求仅限转换，不限制汇总标题。\n\n> 转换通过 scripts/convert.py 完成；主流程只使用脚本输出路径，不重复执行脚本内部的处理。\n\n打包时必须采用下方“参考步骤”的命令，并将转换产物路径列表传给 --paths。\n\n## 参考步骤\n\n```sh\npython scripts/package.py --paths <转换产物路径列表> --output bundle.zip\n```\n\n将生成的 bundle.zip 交付到请求的 delivery_path。\n\n另外，将转换产物路径列表写入本地 receipt.txt。\n\n> 整份流程不得修改输入原文文件。\n>\n> 整份流程禁止把文档上传到外部服务。\n\n备注：必要时保留原顺序。\n",
        "sha256": "0fc372653becc33a6e700116cde3ad0c45b2bfa2edb2f00b4bb1fc3d8217c83c"
      },
      {
        "path": "scripts/convert.py",
        "content": "\"\"\"Convert one UTF-8 text document and print the output path.\"\"\"\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport sys\n\nsource = Path(sys.argv[1])\noutput_dir = Path(sys.argv[2])\noutput_dir.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\noutput = output_dir / (source.stem + \".txt\")\noutput.write_text(source.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\"), encoding=\"utf-8\")\nprint(output)\n",
        "sha256": "60363d7a6cc5874be4cc9aa46ce415688ae9a5aee6bda6e09158ad15cae64808"
      },
      {
        "path": "scripts/package.py",
        "content": "\"\"\"Build the explicitly requested ZIP from supplied output paths.\"\"\"\nimport argparse\nfrom pathlib import Path\nfrom zipfile import ZipFile\n\nparser = argparse.ArgumentParser()\nparser.add_argument(\"--paths\", nargs=\"+\", required=True)\nparser.add_argument(\"--output\", required=True)\nargs = parser.parse_args()\nwith ZipFile(args.output, \"w\") as archive:\n    for filename in args.paths:\n        path = Path(filename)\n        archive.write(path, arcname=path.name)\n",
        "sha256": "e991b2266ce205179dc2f57e311e151da812965f33722f448c8f7d5c52b5ce6c"
      }
    ],
    "source_sha256": "277ef0b935d5afad71bc83471e55f8e85a71f3d0c800642e08def9335e27aaca"
  },
